1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,236
Doctors grew an EAR

2
00:00:01,276 --> 00:00:03,386
inside this woman’s FOREARM.

3
00:00:03,426 --> 00:00:04,871
She lost her ear in a crash,

4
00:00:04,911 --> 00:00:06,591
so surgeons carved a replacement

5
00:00:06,631 --> 00:00:08,386
from her own rib cartilage.

6
00:00:08,426 --> 00:00:09,876
They tucked it beneath her arm skin,

7
00:00:09,916 --> 00:00:12,266
where new blood vessels formed around it.

8
00:00:12,306 --> 00:00:12,861
Months later,

9
00:00:12,901 --> 00:00:14,876
they moved the living ear to her head,

10
00:00:14,916 --> 00:00:17,626
reconnecting its blood supply and nerves.

11
00:00:17,666 --> 00:00:18,886
And for MONTHS…

12
00:00:18,926 --> 00:00:21,006
her new ear was right HERE.

